@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075985 - Take strong reference to doc when script can run in SubmitSubmission  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330118\n", "files": ["dom/html/HTMLFormElement.cpp"], "git_node": "0445f1152ec34a2dafa93e64387b96071bf7bcc8", "git_parents": ["29b8fa8e324caa0336f947bff018f50b8454dbe1"], "node": "821782e6ae43064a2dd4dad83d0078a7555a4f59", "parents": ["8bce58f52d9af4ef02b4c74a3bf0612bb1fb799f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791518553, "git_changesets": ["0445f1152ec34a2dafa93e64387b96071bf7bcc8"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "782": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076268 - Simplify nsGenConInitializer.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nNo need to create the list upfront, do it only when we get to initialize\nthe text frame.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331348\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331954\n", "files": ["layout/base/nsCSSFrameConstructor.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-contain/crashtests/contain-style-discarded-item.html"], "git_node": "11fae0759129d92bd434521ae95af008a95a2c3c", "git_parents": ["0445f1152ec34a2dafa93e64387b96071bf7bcc8"], "node": "46723bcb8ff1710a646544c0f088032eef5afe5b", "parents": ["821782e6ae43064a2dd4dad83d0078a7555a4f59"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076268 - Don't create an unnecessary style scope from AddCounterChanges.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nThis is a bit sketchy over-all, but is enough to prevent the\nfirst-letter code from messing up the style scoping, and I think it's\nsound, because first-letter can never pull a whole inline or somesuch...\n\nThis is only an issue for that code because ::first-letter will create a\nframe for an arbitrarily deep text node (but just the text, which can't\nhave counters). So if it manages to create something for a text node\nthat's about  to go away we end up with a stale scope.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331349\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331955\n", "files": ["layout/base/ContainStyleScopeManager.cpp", "layout/base/nsCounterManager.cpp", "layout/base/nsCounterManager.h", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-contain/crashtests/contain-style-first-letter-colgroup.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-contain/crashtests/contain-style-first-letter.html"], "git_node": "af40ecc78fff50c3384dbcbf14ebec3af27ff896", "git_parents": ["11fae0759129d92bd434521ae95af008a95a2c3c"], "node": "232fd4a4a053b296956a74bd02195e2a9803ed91", "parents": ["46723bcb8ff1710a646544c0f088032eef5afe5b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791518599, "git_changesets": ["11fae0759129d92bd434521ae95af008a95a2c3c", "af40ecc78fff50c3384dbcbf14ebec3af27ff896"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "783": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan-Niklas Jaeschke \u003cjjaschke@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075996 - Check the root element before pretty printing.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331121\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332053\n", "files": ["dom/xml/crashtests/2075996-1.html", "dom/xml/crashtests/2075996-2.html", "dom/xml/crashtests/2075996.sjs", "dom/xml/crashtests/crashtests.list", "dom/xml/nsXMLContentSink.cpp", "dom/xml/nsXMLPrettyPrinter.cpp"], "git_node": "25a15cb5ffd42d673094e8809b4b0167a3c24d35", "git_parents": ["af40ecc78fff50c3384dbcbf14ebec3af27ff896"], "node": "0d3dcfec589282605247bc7666792d9d3e4be1ef", "parents": ["232fd4a4a053b296956a74bd02195e2a9803ed91"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791518628, "git_changesets": ["25a15cb5ffd42d673094e8809b4b0167a3c24d35"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "784": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan Hunt \u003crhunt@mozilla.c