ssage is now only sent by the parent process. Also remove\nCompositorBridgeParent::ForEachLayerTreeStateUnderLock, which has no other\ncaller.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330629\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331093\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/ipc/CompositorBridgeParent.h", "gfx/layers/ipc/ContentCompositorBridgeParent.cpp", "gfx/layers/ipc/ContentCompositorBridgeParent.h"], "git_node": "81107aa492a8037f4439195db8c7ca0f8f8e2287", "git_parents": ["2adbb2145f1168c855da4c5a176f37de18e82bb0"], "node": "2727f807cc8c51b4fd5bffc6ebaeab85e124664d", "parents": ["e70e0b10cf80bf8352c36d99015b701ef714e971"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791643166, "git_changesets": ["81107aa492a8037f4439195db8c7ca0f8f8e2287"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "810": {"changesets": [{"author": "Hiroyuki Ikezoe \u003chikezoe.birchill@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074199 - Make ScrollToCSSPixelsForApz report whether the scroll frame is still alive.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330644\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331448\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/apz/util/APZCCallbackHelper.cpp", "layout/generic/ScrollContainerFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/ScrollContainerFrame.h"], "git_node": "202e2818a41c2189122f423ab3c8670a1a89ecaf", "git_parents": ["81107aa492a8037f4439195db8c7ca0f8f8e2287"], "node": "e41817a9821a1e2a5170c112bc231b1cab1d4e1e", "parents": ["2727f807cc8c51b4fd5bffc6ebaeab85e124664d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791643186, "git_changesets": ["202e2818a41c2189122f423ab3c8670a1a89ecaf"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "811": {"changesets": [{"author": "Tom Schuster \u003ctschuster@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075930 - Remove style's is attribute.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330703\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.service