6fd705bbc035561bb82a91ce5a0408c9e9b"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "814": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan Hunt \u003crhunt@eqrion.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063100 - Scope disabling denormals to wasm JIT code.  a=RyanVM\n\n1. Add ldmxcsr to x86-shared assembler.\n2. Add ContextOptions::wasmDisablesDenormals.\n3. Add --disable-main-thread-wasm-denormals JS shell flag.\n4. Remove --disable-main-thread-denormals JS shell flag.\n5. Add DenormalsDisabled and assert in many places denormals are\n   enabled.\n6. Add wasm::Instance flags/cached mxcsr data.\n7. Add EnterWasmFPEnvironment and LeaveWasmFPEnvironment masm methods\n   which dynamically switch mxcsr.\n8. Update all wasm JIT entry/exits to enter/leave the wasm FP\n   environment.\n9. Remove tests that presume JS running with denormals disabled.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318273\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332593\n", "files": ["js/public/ContextOptions.h", "js/src/builtin/TestingFunctions.cpp", "js/src/gc/GC.cpp", "js/src/jit-test/tests/auto-regress/bug1940716.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/ion/bug1982383.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/ion/bug2014368.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/ion/bug2053680.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/self-test/denormals-1.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/denormals.js", "js/src/jit/Ion.cpp", "js/src/jit/JitContext.cpp", "js/src/jit/x86-shared/Assembler-x86-shared.h", "js/src/jit/x86-shared/BaseAssembler-x86-shared.h", "js/src/jsapi.cpp", "js/src/shell/fuzz-flags.txt", "js/src/shell/js.cpp", "js/src/util/Denormals.h", "js/src/vm/HelperThreads.cpp", "js/src/vm/Interpreter.cpp", "js/src/wasm/WasmBuiltins.cpp", "js/src/wasm/WasmBuiltins.h", "js/src/wasm/WasmFrameIter.cpp", "js/src/wasm/WasmFrameIter.h", "js/src/wasm/WasmInstance.cpp", "js/src/wasm/WasmInstance.h", "js/src/wasm/WasmStubs.cpp"], "git_node": "b77efa8d96ddf7fd1234a761756a63beb3bb48ee", "git_parents": ["4a4c16fd705bbc035561bb82a91ce5a0408c9e9b"], "node": "184494a01bd0191637f20ed5bb5b9d253dc7b24e", "parents": ["66bb50dcb90e1b91c6b41a849598020c9912ea55"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan Hunt \u003crhunt@eqrion.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063100 - Set wasmDisablesDenormals for audio worklets and scope to DSP.  a=RyanVM\n\n1. Add a DenormalsEnabler and organize the internals a bit for sharing\n   code.\n2. Move DenormalsDisabler from OneIterationImpl to Process to scope it\n   to just processing audio.\n3. Add DenoramslEnabler around AudioWorklet script execution\n4. Set wasmDisablesDenormals when creating a JSContext for an\n   AudioWorklet.\n\nThe net effect should be that native audio nodes continue to get DAZ/FTZ,\nJS gets normal IEEE behavior, and wasm gets DAZ/FTZ.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320601\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332594\n", "files": ["dom/media/MediaTrackGraph.cpp", "dom/media/webaudio/AudioWorkletNode.cpp", "dom/media/webaudio/blink/DenormalDisabler.h", "dom/worklet/WorkletFetchHandler.cpp", "testing/web-platform/meta/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-audioworklet-interface/audioworklet-denormals.https.window.js.ini"], "git_node": "642a91ab32d364c3189c62b8d629845cf077bbdd", "git_parents": ["b77efa8d96ddf7fd1234a761756a63beb3bb48ee"], "node": "6659124a6c65102a413e61ac0a64b8b403384987", "parents": ["184494a01bd0191637f20ed5bb5b9d253dc7b24e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791643313, "git_changesets": ["b77efa8d96ddf7fd1234a761756a63beb3bb48ee", "642a91ab32d364c3189c62b8d629845cf077bbdd"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "815": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080397 - Fix test failures on ESR153 after Amazon removal.  a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332693\n", "files": ["browser/components/search/test/browser/browser_addSearchEngineFromForm.js", "browser/components/touchbar/tests/