"rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "918": {"changesets": [{"author": "Iain Ireland \u003ciireland@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075990: Make typed loads non-movable  a=RyanVM\n\nTyped loads are used in self-hosted code to access reserved slots. In cases where the contents of a reserved slot depend on control flow, we want to ensure that the load isn't hoisted above the code that guards it.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332615\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333714\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/regexp/bug2075990.js", "js/src/jit/WarpCacheIRTranspiler.cpp"], "git_node": "a090b261103e9225c5c3b626c6edc11e160482a7", "git_parents": ["48b10843091bee049334b86e01e7456eaa3bc3b8"], "node": "5116200204987164b57d4ba6f4ad867dcdf33577", "parents": ["a57f9d4a36841fa48b5a2d9dcb817f086feaaef9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792017312, "git_changesets": ["a090b261103e9225c5c3b626c6edc11e160482a7"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "919": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079057 - Add missing gfxUserFontSet.h include to gfxPlatformFontList.h. a=bustage\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxPlatformFontList.h"], "git_node": "e67455b11974806a804cea8d616426f2ccdc62da", "git_parents": ["a090b261103e9225c5c3b626c6edc11e160482a7"], "node": "3a14680cce8feb84d3039a89281f6f3a537900f7", "parents": ["5116200204987164b57d4ba6f4ad867dcdf33577"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051358 - Restore the ESR153 bounds/clip argument order in add_pattern_prim. a=bustage\n\nThe uplifted seam fix swapped add_pattern_prim's rect arguments to match the coverage/pattern QuadPrimitive\nlayout from bug 2049363, which ESR153 doesn't have, so the pattern was mapped onto the clip rect.\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/quad.rs"], "git_node": "ef66569adf40b9860