ent.cpp", "dom/base/Document.h", "dom/base/FragmentOrElement.cpp", "dom/base/FragmentOrElement.h", "dom/base/RadioGroupContainer.cpp", "dom/base/RadioGroupContainer.h", "dom/html/HTMLInputElement.cpp", "dom/html/HTMLInputElement.h"], "git_node": "256de8624ca531c5d23d18317cecb9abafd14183", "git_parents": ["8c4c984288a64631d7edb31fd74d6c27acff3c60"], "node": "20cf8e7f71866035627a4f6de48b458d07cc5959", "parents": ["2b14dd93b3f589167136d5c265ead9b8f949e876"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792260586, "git_changesets": ["256de8624ca531c5d23d18317cecb9abafd14183"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "981": {"changesets": [{"author": "Vincent Hilla \u003cvhilla@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082127 - Optimize Element::AddToIdTable.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334411\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334645\n", "files": ["dom/base/Element.cpp"], "git_node": "2bc2594eb33510511cc958fc324c5a2d9df911d4", "git_parents": ["256de8624ca531c5d23d18317cecb9abafd14183"], "node": "a3e0f42af8497d90ced1506e91b58478fba3c7d0", "parents": ["20cf8e7f71866035627a4f6de48b458d07cc5959"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792260663, "git_changesets": ["2bc2594eb33510511cc958fc324c5a2d9df911d4"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "982": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan-Niklas Jaeschke \u003cjjaschke@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082061 - Hold a strong reference to the document in media and image stream listeners.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334055\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334796\n", "files": ["dom/html/ImageDocument.cpp", "dom/html/MediaDocument.cpp"], "git_node": "23637f6440561a99014852d9cb16914ef05a1a53", "git_parents": ["2bc2594eb33510511cc958fc324c5a2d9df911d4"], "node": "7e5820da8df2d260cbd71ba1dd4958055333529e", "parents": ["a3e0f42af8497d90ced1506e91b58478fba3c7d0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792260686, "git_changesets": ["23637f6440561a99014852d9cb16914ef05a1a53"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "983": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082064.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nThe crashtest only crashes on ASAN builds but works.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334529\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334822\n", "files": ["layout/generic/MiddleCroppingBlockFrame.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/rendering/widgets/file-type-label-update-crash.https.html"], "git_node": "135d1c19b9c430265826ee213c88f24b09e79903", "git_parents": ["23637f6440561a99014852d9cb16914ef05a1a53"], "node": "034bd384bdd6e778c950c55876a24edf0d784452", "parents": ["7e5820da8df2d260cbd71ba1dd4958055333529e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792260711, "git_changesets": ["135d1c19b9c430265826ee213c88f24b09e79903"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "984": {"changesets": [{"author": "longsonr \u003clongsonr@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082112 - batch updates before adding or removing switch children  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334491\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334753\n", "files": ["dom/svg/SVGSwitchElement.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/svg/struct/scripted/switch_reentrant_removal.html"], "git_node": "fdc948cb6612bf79144f4f13855018dcd0db0562", "git_parents": ["135d1c19b9c430265826ee213c88f24b09e79903"], "node": "00958a451834608a49351ea2fbbfa54bda525c03", "parents": ["034bd384bdd6e778c950c55876a24edf0d784452"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792260737, "git_changesets": ["fdc948cb6612bf79144f4f13855018dcd0db0562"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "985": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081977 - Deal better with style changes in replicated subtrees.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nQuite a massive hammer, but simple and should be correct / fix a lot of\nthese issues at once.\n\nWe'd need to reframe the root for replicated fixed pos, and would need to\nreframe at least the replicated table for the replicated rowgroups.\n\nHowever since nsPageSequenceFrame will bail on incremental reflow\n(bug 1152354), well...\n\nOther bugs that I found while at this are that nsTableCellMap::Synchronize\nand nsTableFrame::ResetRowIndices only look at a single table continuation.\nA dynamic row-group removal leaks a cell map.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334564\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334851\n", "files": ["layout/base/nsCSSFrameConstructor.cpp", "layout/generic/nsIFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsIFrame.h", "layout/style/RestyleManager.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/printing/fixed-container-query-removal-crash-print.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/printing/table-row-group-container-query-crash-print.html"], "git_node": "b45d5bab7f79067fdf33da8f1bc888261a8624d5", "git_parents": ["fdc948cb6612bf79144f4f13855018dcd0db0562"], "node": "dd362d6999acf2d09938a2007a539fa1a44e30de", "parents": ["00958a451834608a49351ea2fbbfa54bda525c03"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081977 - Share generated content pseudo-elements and skip counters for extra frames.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nRepeated table headers and replicated fixed-pos frames used to create\nnew pseudo-element containers and counter nodes for each copy, which\nconfused the generated content lists.\n\nReuse the original pseudo-element instead, and don't make extra frames\nparticipate in counters.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334565\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334852\n", "files": ["layout/base/crashtests/crashtests.list", "layout/base/crashtests/repeated-counter-marker.html", "layout/base/crashtests/repeated-counter-marker.sjs", "layout/base/crashtests/repeated-generated-content.html", "layout/base/nsCSSFrameConstructor.cpp", "layout/base/nsCSSFrameConstructor.h"], "git_node": "3a6c8f3fb093bdddd7de6a9dc3dab6533c466e44", "git_parents": ["b45d5bab7f79067fdf33da8f1bc888261a8624d5"], "node": "bc1ade5fb3aab70782644f52822a32bb5879b80c", "parents": ["dd362d6999acf2d09938a2007a539fa1a44e30de"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792260765, "git_changesets": ["b45d5bab7f79067fdf33da8f1bc888261a8624d5", "3a6c8f3fb093bdddd7de6a9dc3dab6533c466e44"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "986": {"changesets": [{"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082139: Fail live alt-data readers when the alt-data writer fails  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334172\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334705\n", "files": ["netwerk/cache2/CacheFile.cpp", "netwerk/cache2/CacheFileChunk.cpp", "netwerk/cache2/CacheFileInputStream.h"], "git_node": "a5937036dafa36d306e496dc5000833b4118a903", "git_parents": ["3a6c8f3fb093bdddd7de6a9dc3dab6533c466e44"], "node": "338ce2473f89fd62de4fb717b7b0595a80e3034b", "parents": ["bc1ade5fb3aab70782644f52822a32bb5879b80c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082139: Reject incomplete compressed script bytecode  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334173\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334706\n", "files": ["dom/script/ScriptCompression.cpp"], "git_node": "e57fb874d5aa42532221782fdefa7102ea278e5d", "git_parents": ["a5937036dafa36d306e496dc5000833b4118a903"], "node": "bbc21576b8c211d9708c159479905b294360db00", "parents": ["338ce2473f89fd62de4fb717b7b0595a80e3034b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Randell Jesup \u